# =============================================
# 数据文件：不入库，应为运行时产物或本地数据
# =============================================
.zvt/
data_lake/
# write_parquet_atomic 的锁文件是常驻 inode（storage_ops.FileLock 故意不 unlink），
# 不是残留；*.parquet 已忽略，但 *.parquet.lock 会被 `git add .` 扫进来。
*.parquet.lock
# 运行时审计产物（risk_audit.jsonl 等）。不加这行 `git add .` 会把
# 测试运行时追加的审计行提交进库。
data/execution/
artifacts/
期货level2五档数据/
*.db
*.parquet
*.csv
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.feather
*.pkl
# The golden-sample fixture is a deliverable (S2), not runtime data. Without
# this exemption `*.parquet` silently drops it from `git add .`, and a fresh
# clone fails at `pd.read_parquet` with FileNotFoundError — a silent omission.
!tests/golden/*.parquet

